<title>HUNGARY: Hungary says ready to privatise busmaker Ikarus.</title>
<headline>Hungary says ready to privatise busmaker Ikarus.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hungarian government asked the Finance Minister and the Privatisation Minister on Thursday to move immediately towards issuing open tenders for the privatisation and liabilities of Hungarian busmaker Ikarus .</p>
<p>It gave no more details but added that the company's annual 10,000 to 12,000 bus production in the past few years has fallen to 1,000 to 1,500 in the lack of orders.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
